// Numbers only: landmark positions of two 6 second windows of two public clips. No image, no video.
// Each row is one frame: left hip x y, left knee x y, left ankle x y, the smallest visibility of the left leg,
// then the same 7 numbers for the right leg. Positions are fractions of the frame. 36 frames are taken at even
// steps from the frames of the window, which starts at 6 seconds in each clip: 36 frames for window A and 60 for window B.
